# Google service-account keys for tests/traffic.mjs. The key grants read access
# to GA4 and Search Console; committing one publishes it. Keep it outside the
# repo entirely and point GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS at it — these patterns
# are a backstop for the copy that ends up here anyway.
*service-account*.json
*-key.json
gcp-*.json
credentials.json
# the OAuth refresh token normally lives in ~/.config/neobankbeat/, but
# NB_GOOGLE_TOKEN can point anywhere — including here by accident
google-oauth.json
